  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">From Protocol to Practice: A Bridge to Global Action on Forced Labor - Phase II (The Bridge Project II)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bridge II will improve global, regional, and country-level capacity to eliminate forced labor through the framework, principles, and guidance of the 2014 ILO Protocol and Recommendation on Forced Labor. The project will build on the accomplishments and lessons learned from the first phase (Bridge I, 2015-2022), and target new sectors, countries, and vulnerable groups.</narrative>
  </description>
